This adapter uses SineStack AI contracts and the shared transport which depend on
Vercel AI SDK (Copyright 2023 Vercel, Inc.; Apache-2.0).
Provider methods perform single protocol operations. Retry, signal composition,
callbacks and waiting belong to the shared core and pinned AI SDK helpers.
The World Labs OpenAPI specification and documentation were used as protocol
references; no official SDK execution engine is copied or embedded.
